OL,3,ABBC appoints Rachel Jupp as new
OL,4,Adirector of news
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Jupp has been appointed the new
OL,7,Fdirector of BBC News, nearly a year
OL,8,Fafter the previous CEO resigned.
OL,10,FDeborah Turness announced last November
OL,11,Fthat she would step down from the role
OL,12,Ffollowing the fallout over how Panorama
OL,13,Fedited a speech by President Trump.
OL,15,FJupp is a former deputy editor of BBC
OL,16,FTwo's Newsnight and has also served as
OL,17,FPanorama's editor, but left several
OL,18,Fyears before the controversial Trump
OL,19,Fepisode aired.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
